- Drop frames

``` c++
attr.id = SAI_ACL_ENTRY_ATTR_ACTION_PACKET_ACTION;
attr.value.aclaction.parameter.s32 = SAI_PACKET_ACTION_DROP;
attr.value.aclaction.enable = true;
```

